### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### LOOKUP FIELDS WORKFLOW - Transaction System
### Base Route: api/LookUpFields
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7010
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..Q2jA5PJdQpjOZ9F0wnU_2GCorgyE4UQlEIGWMeofAmQ

@lookUpFieldId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 1. GET ALL LOOKUP FIELDS
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/LookUpFields
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 2. GET LOOKUP FIELD BY ID
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/LookUpFields/{{lookUpFieldId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 3. CREATE LOOKUP FIELD
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/LookUpFields
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filedName": "DepartmentType",
  "description": "Types of departments"
}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4. UPDATE LOOKUP FIELD
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/LookUpFields/{{lookUpFieldId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filedName": "UpdatedFieldName",
  "description": "Updated description"
}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 5. DELETE LOOKUP FIELD
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/LookUpFields/{{lookUpFieldId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
